Interview-Level Summary (What They Expect)

If interviewer asks:

"How do you deploy in Salesforce?"

Answer like this:

For small changes → Change Sets
For real projects → SFDX + Git
CI/CD pipelines for automation
Always validate + run tests before deploy
Follow branching strategy and code reviews
